cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use BrowserTransactionBench in research, please cite this software.
title: BrowserTransactionBench
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Raghav
abstract: >-
  BrowserTransactionBench is an exploratory research harness for evaluating
  transactional safety in browser agents. It separates authoritative durable
  effect truth, verified ambiguity delivery, and agent belief under
  post-commit acknowledgement loss.
repository-code: https://github.com/lamenting-hawthorn/browserbench
license: MIT
keywords:
  - agent evaluation
  - browser agents
  - exactly-once effects
  - reproducible research
  - transactional safety
